 on from Thurlstan Road.\nThe run will be on the XC course and if you’d ma
 ybe wondered what it might be like\, then this is your time to have a go\, 
 or if you just want to run the course before January 4th.\nI’m hoping we 
 may get some more people signed up especially as we are hosting the event\,
  so join me today. We shall walk/run hills\, but no one left behind.\nIt is
  a 2 lap course\, so the option of just one lap.\n\nAny questions Sarah [Ph
 one Number Redacted]\n\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/2087
 05/group_events/3438677845121701806\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Mo
 n\, 29 Dec @ 10:33 PM
