 oping we may get some more people signed up especially as we are hosting th
 e event\, so join me today. We shall walk/run hills\, but no one left behin
 d.It is a 2 lap course\, so the option of just one lap.Any questions Sarah 
 [Phone Number Redacted]View on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/
